---
layout: layouts/base.njk
tone: navy
stage: coral
title: "Upper Secondary"
description: "Upper Secondary at Palm River Academy for students aged 14 to 18. An academic plan built around your child's goal, usually a US high school diploma, mixed with a personal project, a trip the students plan themselves and, for some, an internship or a turn helping in the younger classes."
---
{% import "macros/icons.njk" as ic %}

{% set heroPhoto = "students-waterfall-field-trip" %}
{% set heroEyebrow = "Upper Secondary · ages 14 to 18" %}
{% set heroTitle = 'A plan built around <span class="mark">your child</span>' %}
{% set heroText = "We sit down with you and your child, talk about where they want to go, and build an academic plan for it. Most work towards a US high school diploma, with a teacher coaching them in the room." %}
{% include "partials/pagehero.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--stage">How it works</p>
      <h2>First, a conversation</h2>
      <p class="lede">Every student's plan is their own. We start with where they want to end up.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cards cards--3 mt">
      <div class="card">{{ ic.icon("chat", "blue") }}<h3>Talk it through</h3><p>We meet you and your child, look at what they have done so far, and agree a goal: university abroad, a career, or something they have not named yet.</p></div>
      <div class="card">{{ ic.icon("book", "green") }}<h3>Academics that fit</h3><p>Most students work towards a US high school diploma through accredited online courses, with a PRA teacher coaching them every morning. The subjects and the pace follow the plan.</p></div>
      <div class="card">{{ ic.icon("tools", "coral") }}<h3>Learning by doing</h3><p>Alongside the coursework, students learn by doing: a personal project each year, sometimes an internship or a turn helping in the younger classes, and a trip they plan themselves.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "pale" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
<section class="band--pale" id="day">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--stage">Monday to Friday</p>
      <h2>An Upper Secondary day</h2>
      <p class="lede">Mornings on their own courses, afternoons together.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt">{% set dayKey = "upper-secondary" %}{% include "partials/dayline.njk" %}</div>
    <p class="table-note center">Afternoons mix Movement, Wellbeing, a choice of Maker Space or Art of Science, and study time. <a href="{{ '/families/schedule/#upper-secondary' | url }}">See the week at a glance</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
{% set waveColor = "white" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap two">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--blue">Beyond the coursework</p>
      <h2>Projects, a trip and more</h2>
      <h3>The personal project</h3>
      <p>One project a year, their choice: a business, research, a film, an app, a garden. They set the goal, we hold them to it, they present it.</p>
      <h3>Internships</h3>
      <p>Some students also take on an internship when it fits their plan. Ask us what might be possible for your child.</p>
      <h3>Helping in the younger classes</h3>
      <p>Some students spend part of their week assisting in a Primary or Early Years class, working alongside the teacher and the younger children. Ask us what might be possible for your child.</p>
      <h3>The trip</h3>
      <p>Once a year the Upper Secondary students plan an educational trip: destination, budget, itinerary, logistics. They do the spreadsheets. We check them.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="leaf-wrap leaf-wrap--r has-sticker">
      <span class="sticker sticker--coral sticker--tr">Projects and a trip</span>
      {% photo "secondary-student-helping-primary", "photo--lg photo--tilt" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--stage">Internships</p>
      <h2>Time in a real job</h2>
      <p class="lede">When it fits the plan, a student spends part of their week working in a local business.</p>
    </div>
    {% set collagePhotos = ["upper-internship-bakery", "upper-internship-drinks", "upper-internship-counter"] %}
    {% include "partials/collage.njk" %}
    <div class="center narrow mt">
      <p>Front of house, the kitchen, the till. They turn up on time, take instructions from someone who is not their teacher, and find out what a working day is actually like. Ask us what might be possible for your child.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--stage">Maths off the page</p>
      <h2>Measure it yourself</h2>
      <p class="lede">The quickest way to believe a formula is to go and get the numbers.</p>
    </div>
    {% set collagePhotos = ["upper-maths-mirror-method", "upper-maths-mirror-measuring", "upper-maths-measuring-up"] %}
    {% include "partials/collage.njk" %}
    <div class="center narrow mt">
      <p>Height from a mirror on the floor and a pair of similar triangles. A gradient from rise over run, measured across the room. The answer is checked against the thing itself, not against the back of the book.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "pale" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
<section class="band--pale">
  <div class="wrap two two--flip">
    <div class="leaf-wrap leaf-wrap--tint">
      {% photo "upper-own-courses-together", "photo--lg photo--tilt-r" %}
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">After PRA</p>
      <h2>Where our students have gone</h2>
      <p>More than ten former students are at high schools and universities overseas: in the US and Australia, and at international schools in Hà Nội, Đà Nẵng and India.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

